<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Korea Development Bank issue rated AA-minus.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Korea Development Bank issue rated AA-minus.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ratings agency Standard and Poor's said on Wednesday it had assigned its AA-minus rating to the Korea Development Bank's (KDB) forthcoming US$500 million global bond issue.</p>
<p>It said the rating outlook was stable.</p>
</text>
